B.bC5=new A.md(B.Jd,B.ca,"Summary Cards (top row)",'These four cards show the CURRENT PERIOD ONLY \u2014 they never include carry-forward.\n\n\u2022 Total Purchases \u2014 sum of every purchase invoice total in the selected range.\n\u2022 Total Sales \u2014 sum of every sales invoice total in the range.\n\u2022 Gross Profit \u2014 Sales Net Amount minus Purchase Net Amount (both excl. GST).\n\u2022 Net GST Payable \u2014 GST collected on sales minus GST paid on purchases (ITC).\n\n"Total" means the final invoice amount including GST, discounts, courier, packaging, and round-off.')
B.bC0=new A.md(B.dp,B.Ge,"GST Intelligence Bar","\u2022 GST Collected \u2014 total output tax from all sales invoices in the period.\n\u2022 GST Paid (ITC) \u2014 total input tax from all purchases (your tax credit).\n\u2022 Net Payable \u2014 GST Collected minus GST Paid. This is what you owe for GSTR-3B.\n\u2022 Slab breakdown shows the net split by IGST / CGST / SGST.\n\nIf Net Payable is negative, your ITC exceeds output tax \u2014 the excess credit carries forward.")
B.bC_=new A.md(B.rT,B.dW,"Business Performance Row","\u2022 Revenue (excl. GST) \u2014 sum of all bill taxable amounts (after discounts + additional charges, before GST). Your actual earned revenue.\n\u2022 Cost of Goods \u2014 sum of all purchase taxable amounts (after discounts + additional charges, before GST).\n\u2022 Gross Profit \u2014 Revenue minus Cost of Goods.\n\u2022 Effective Tax Rate \u2014 Net GST Payable \xf7 Revenue \xd7 100.\n\u2022 ITC Eligible \u2014 total GST on purchases claimable as input tax credit.")
B.bC1=new A.md(B.ds,B.aR,"Sales / Tax Invoices Table","Each row is one sales invoice in the selected period.\n\n\u2022 Taxable Amt. \u2014 items total minus discount plus additional charges (courier, packaging, etc.) before GST. This is the actual base on which GST is levied.\n\u2022 GST columns \u2014 only slabs actually used appear (e.g. 18% IGST, 9%+9%). Each shows tax for that slab.\n\u2022 Total \u2014 full amount including GST, charges, and round-off.\n\u2022 Totals row \u2014 period sum of all columns for GSTR-3B reference.\n\nThe Opening Balance (Carry Fwd.) row appears at the top when a snapshot exists.")
